Package: spadesBioInfo.viz
Type: Package
Title: Shared Presentation Layer for the spades_bioinformatics Workbench
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Allen", "Larocque", email = "allen.larocque@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The shared plotting style (project palette + ggplot theme accessors) and the
    review-bundle layout writer used by the workbench's presentation modules. Decoupled from
    spadesBioInfo.core so plot-only changes never invalidate the compute modules' cache.
